        "text": "Skip navigation menu\n## assemblymember Buffy Wicks\n# ORGANIZER. ADVOCATE.\nMOM.\nDefending the East Bay.\n## assemblymember Buffy Wicks\n# ORGANIZER. ADVOCATE.\nMOM.\nDefending the East Bay.\n## HONEST LEADERSHIP. REAL RESULTS.\n\"When you see injustices in the world, you want to be a part of the change. Our community deserves more - that's why I'm running for re-election. California is and must remain a beacon of hope.\"\nLearn more\n###### Buffy's priorities\nBuffy has fought in Sacramento for results-driven, concrete change for over 8 years. She is focused on:\n#### Affordable Housing\n#### Homelessness\n#### Child Safety\n#### Consumer Protection\n#### Fighting for Working Families\n## Chip in to Buffy's campaign:\n$10\n$25\n$50\n$100\n$250\nOther\n$10$25$50$100$250Other\n###### sign up to\n## Get Involved",
